ou.\\rThe Trainers all look like the\\nGym Leader, Janine.\\rWhich of them is the real Janine?","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00006":"That was a great battle,\\nTrainer from Johto!","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00007":"Fooled you!\\nHahaha!\\r","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00008":"Well? Wasn’t my disguise perfect?","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00009":"Wahahaha!\\rYou betcha! I’m Janine!\\r","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00010":"That’s right, I’m a boy!\\nWhat’s wrong with a boy\\fdressing up as Janine?","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00011":"Fufufu!\\rI’m Janine, the Gym Leader!\\fWait, no I’m not! Gotcha!\\r","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00012":"Fooled you!\\nHahaha!\\r","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00013":"It’s so fun to dress up as Janine,\\nour idol!","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00014":"I’m Janine!\\nHow did you know I was real?\\fLet’s battle!\\r","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00015":"Or not!\\r","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00016":"I feel stronger dressing up as Janine.","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00017":"Fuchsia City Pokémon Gym","msg_0514_T08GYM0101_00018":"Fuchsia City Pokémon Gym\\rLeader: Janine\\nCertified Trainer!\\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_000 + 1","OnLoad":"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_008 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T08GYM0101_008":8,"obj_T08GYM0101_picnicgirl_2":0,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsgirl1":1,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsleader13":2,"obj_T08GYM0101_sunglasses":3,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsgirl1_2":4,"obj_T08GYM0101_campboy_2":5,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsleader13_2":6,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsleader13_3":7,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsleader13_4":8,"obj_T08GYM0101_gsleader13_5":9}}
